-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party data

The Cordon engine has no third-party runtime dependencies.

Rule packs and threat-intelligence databases distributed alongside Cordon may
incorporate third-party data under separate terms. Every pack declares its own
`license` and `source` fields, and any pack whose licence is incompatible with
Apache-2.0 is distributed separately rather than bundled with this
distribution.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Syft

src/cordon_scanner/images/data/java-groups.json is derived from Syft
(https://github.com/anchore/syft), Copyright Anchore, Inc., by
scripts/build/syft_java_groups.py: the map from Java artifact names to the Maven groups
that publish them (cpegenerate.DefaultArtifactIDToGroupID). The version it was
built from is recorded in the file. It is used under the Apache License,
Version 2.0, the licence above.

